function hpTouchFeedback(direction){try{if(typeof CodiceAndroid!=='undefined'&&CodiceAndroid.haptic)CodiceAndroid.haptic();else if(typeof navigator!=='undefined')navigator.vibrate?.(12);}catch{}const pressed=document.querySelector(direction>0?'.hp-plus':'.hp-minus');if(pressed?.animate)pressed.animate([{transform:'scale(.89)',filter:'brightness(1.4)'},{transform:'scale(1)',filter:'brightness(1)'}],{duration:220});const panel=document.querySelector('.session-health');if(panel?.animate)panel.animate([{filter:'brightness(1)'},{filter:'brightness(1.22)'},{filter:'brightness(1)'}],{duration:240});}
// Luzes que recebem posição, duração e trajetória novas após cada aparição.
